<h2>Syntax</h2>
<pre>
{{SonglistEntry|1
|title=Song Title
|yt=YouTubeID
|nnd=sm12345678
|bb=BV1Aw411Z7VS
|feat={{feat|[[Singer Name]]}}
|info={{Orikyoku|with=[[Producer]]}}
|date=2025.05.01
}}
</pre>

<h2>Parameters</h2>
{| class="wikitable"
! Parameter !! Description
|-
| <code>1</code> (positional) || Row number
|-
| <code>title</code> || Song title (plain text)
|-
| <code>yt</code> || YouTube video ID (optional)
|-
| <code>nnd</code> || NicoNico video ID, e.g. <code>sm12345</code> (optional)
|-
| <code>bb</code> || Bilibili video ID, e.g. <code>BV1Aw411Z7VS</code> (optional)
|-
| <code>ytinfo</code> / <code>nndinfo</code> || Tooltip text for the video link
|-
| <code>feat</code> || Featured artist(s) — use <code>{{feat&#124;Name}}</code>
|-
| <code>info</code> || Additional information — accepts wikitext
|-
| <code>oss</code> / <code>otherstreamingservices</code> || Extra streaming links appended after YT/NND/BB
|-
| <code>date</code> || Upload date, e.g. <code>2025.05.01</code>
|}

{{Documentation}}
